<description>&lt;p&gt;Ansar al-Sunna militants killed six civilians in Nangade and forced peasant farmers to abandon fields in Cabo Delgado, limiting humanitarian access. Opposition leader Mondlane reported state abuses during a Supreme Court trial and denied ordering the destruction of road-toll infrastructure. The government continues to push a large LNG megaproject and DP World port expansion despite the insecurity. Temporary tents restore healthcare services for more than 7 thousand people in Marrangira, Niassa, according to the WHO Regional Office for Africa.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOa0pwR0dzRlhEVTFyZ1RnZ2F3QXFIZGlUTE1WbU1feGcxZDBtckhZOHB4dUJjSHJXWjk4czkxSUo5d280bmc3bURsMVhLNDVuNV83ZVNVVThRZU5zUE5XWmZwVHNzQUlVM0ltelFDRGhCdWlkV1hLQ2Q3U2ZhOUlyN0FTVjJ5RWZ1VEZhM0h4SGRmbnVFZGlCTkVrNXhUY3FETG54b3A0N05qekc1M2VpUDJ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE1xNkxaRW04RWpkc1RrOV9zNW1GeGVWVUlxdEVWSzlGTHJSRi13enF4S2QyOElKcktSazdzYWFmNl9Kbkh6dVpBQmVWTG44akV3NkFxUGhpVzVpTjhaaGtNbnZWZl9ZUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNMXNOelpaTjdNSklIS0w3M2NBaDFLclFsakIxbENwLVNCLUdtZjROTVJWMHcyWENKX0lOWjFDYVJCWVJlUWRBOHdya2QxRU9KTkltQjBNY2tPRGNqa2hKTnZqcXdfYXo5dmNtRXdjTW9GbFVGVS0zeDg0VnY2N2NfXzhhd2JDekJpWlA1QWtGZ0hWbFNGdWRoNUp5YUFuOVpUQVFlZ0xhUmNVQ2VWOUpnZEw2enhUZUJhaC1VcjItVDFHQ0VBVlVpcg?oc=5&quot;&gt;thenational.co.za&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxOVDFWbURZbldmZVU2Z2U2dWlUaEhSN2NqemV1VHlwLW80dlZYc1VzdkhmZEoxd2pTS1JETDZyRURwcl9Gendwb3YyNXdSU1ZDMU0tVkkyaW9HSXRpMUtORmFKNXU4ajJVNXlwSENkS3A2TVpvNElYVXcwSlhrYlh1X2p0SEdyZExjVjg2UUZGVHhJUUM4VGp2dG1aMGJZckI0WVl